    <briefdescription>
<para>Stores and retrieves scheduled task execution results in ThemisDB. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Key layout in RocksDB: <computeroutput>_sched_result/&lt;task_id&gt;/&lt;timestamp_ms_zero_padded_20&gt;</computeroutput></para>
<para>This ordering lets us scan all results for a task via a prefix scan and retrieve the most-recent N entries with a reverse scan capped at <computeroutput>limit</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
